		(property "Description" "Onboard TYPE-C power breakout, 21.6 x 12.7 mm body; solder all six 2.54 mm header pins into 1.0 mm plated carrier holes; pad order CC2, D+, D-, CC1, GND, VBUS; only VBUS/+5V and GND wired, remaining carrier pads isolated; no module screw holes; outline scaled from the vendor dimension photo, dry-fit before fabrication; verify pin fit, USB cable access and insulated underside clearance before soldering; use regulated 5V source and verify both 5.1k CC sink resistors; retain D1 isolation to Pico VSYS"
